        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A horror puzzle exploration game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Story]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, your girlfriend Marin got in touch with you and told you that she was being pestered by a strange person who claimed to be a new tenant recruited by the landlord. Not long after moving in, he began to renovate the house and always did some outrageous things intentionally or unintentionally. Marin told you that she has contacted the landlord, but the landlord has not replied to the message yet. And she can't find a new place to live in the short term, so she hopes you will come over first...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's worse, your wife's condition is deteriorating. If you run away directly, it might lead to consequences you don't want to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Feature]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Your wife's condition will directly affect your efficiency in exploring the map. Through interesting interactions, awaken her memory and help her resist strange states</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Some interactive sound effects are voiced by mouth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· A rendering style similar to that of horror comics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Playing for a long time might make you afraid of frying pans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Hint]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you need to pay attention to the interaction prompts. They usually tell you what items you need to interact with to advance the process</p>",
